    "Lineage: written by hand (stage 3, record), by whoever maintains this repo. No script writes it.",
    "Each app holds only its definition: id, name, version (the exact version installed), checked (the version that was checked end to end: design/checks/<app>.txt, the report of `mise run app:check <app>` in design/, must say that version passed; an app without it is unchecked and gets no MCP servers), port (its control port, given once checked), overrides (only where it differs from design/family.json, in the same shape) and proof (the tool calls that make a change you can see in the app, which app:check makes). What every app shares is in design/family.json; how particular apps behave is in docs/problems.md.",
    "Read by: every stage in design/ (merged with design/family.json by design/scripts/app-merge.jq) and mise-tasks/apps/status. Generates, through design/scripts/5-config-generate: the repo root's mise.toml and servers.json."
